 (text "ESC power stage: DRV8323RS + 12 x CSD18510Q5B + 3 shunts" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "e778b7cc-2b93-5b33-9802-12f01a37bdcc"))
(text "VESC-6 class, Trampa HD60 pin map (firmware/vesc/hw_atlas_drv1). 6x PWM from TIM1: PA8-10 high, PB13-15 low." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "c09e72fa-024b-59ce-aa01-29efbdc5815b"))
(text "Two FETs per switch, 2.2 Ohm gate resistor each. Shunts 0.2 mOhm, CSA gain 40 V/V: +-206 A." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "1f1cb2e4-184f-536f-bf68-573c4a3aee92"))
(text "Phase and bus sense 39k / 2.2k (as VESC). PC13 switches 10 nF phase filters in (HW_HAS_PHASE_FILTERS)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "9e1fa814-0ab7-5b35-bee6-48c6279eb5de"))
(text "DC link: 4 x 330 uF 35 V hybrid polymer (12.8 mm tall: clears the brain board NVMe) + 12 x 10 uF 1210 ceramics." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "4c866941-90b8-5668-8664-5c904287be6c"))
(text "E-stop: DRV ENABLE = PB5 AND the E-stop loop (74LVC1G08), so an open loop stops the gates with no firmware." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "9975d7e8-ef1b-563a-8746-9d0b90b701be"))
